### Door one: the REST API. You, the developer, already know these endpoints.

### List every restaurant
GET http://localhost:7071/api/restaurants

### Filter by cuisine and city
GET http://localhost:7071/api/restaurants?cuisine=Italian&city=Nijmegen

### Get a menu
GET http://localhost:7071/api/restaurants/r1/menu

### Place an order
POST http://localhost:7071/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "r1",
  "itemName": "Margherita",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Door two lives at http://localhost:7071/runtime/webhooks/mcp
### (streamable HTTP). Connect an MCP client to it instead of calling it
### by hand; see .vscode/mcp.json and the README.
